---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
import { breadcrumbJsonLd, organizationJsonLd } from '../../lib/seo';
import { SITE_URL } from '../../lib/site';
---

<Base
  locale="en"
  title="About — Escortwijzer"
  description="Who we are, how this site is funded and the criteria we score platforms against. Full transparency about our affiliation with Intimate."
  path="/en/about/"
  alternates={{ nl: '/nl/over-ons/', en: '/en/about/' }}
  jsonLd={[
    organizationJsonLd(),
    breadcrumbJsonLd([
      { name: 'Home', url: `${SITE_URL}/en/` },
      { name: 'About', url: `${SITE_URL}/en/about/` },
    ]),
  ]}
>
  <h1 class="display text-3xl sm:text-4xl">About</h1>
  <div class="prose mt-8">
    <p>
      Escortwijzer is an editorial guide to legal adult services in the Netherlands: what the
      law says, what services cost, how to stay safe, and how the Dutch platforms compare.
    </p>
    <h2>Transparency: our affiliation with Intimate</h2>
    <p>
      This site is an independent editorial project by the team behind
      <a href="https://intimate.nl" rel="noopener">Intimate</a>, a Dutch platform for verified
      listings. We state this wherever relevant, because as a reader you should be able to
      weigh who is writing.
    </p>
    <p>
      In practice: our reviews — including the one of Intimate itself — follow the same
      <a href="/en/platforms/methodology/">published criteria</a>, with scores you can check.
      Competitors get credit where they are strong; Intimate gets criticism where it is due. A
      guide that only praises its own shop is useful to no one.
    </p>
    <h2>How we work</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Legal articles reference official sources (national government, municipalities).</li>
      <li>Reviews are scored per criterion; the methodology is published before any ranking.</li>
      <li>Every article shows its publication date and the date of the last substantive change.</li>
      <li>We do not accept paid placements in reviews or rankings.</li>
    </ul>
    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>Questions or corrections? Email redactie@escortwijzer.nl.</p>
  </div>
</Base>
